    {
      "id": "fc62e6c0-10e7-4312-bfb4-ab8c48cce68b",
      "name": "Build catalog text",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        448,
        112
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "const request = $('Order agent trigger').first().json.request;\nconst lines = $input.all().map(function (i) { const p = i.json; return p.SKU + ' | ' + p.Name + ' | ' + p.Unit + ' | in stock: ' + p.Stock; });\nreturn [{ json: { request: request, catalog: lines.join('\\n') } }];"
      },
      "notes": "Why Code: folds the catalog rows into ONE item so the AI agent runs once. The text has NO prices on purpose: the AI never sees or handles money."
    },
    {
      "id": "ca20b3c3-a598-443f-865c-56c2adf3563f",
      "name": "Order extractor",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        672,
        112
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.request }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=You are the Order Agent of Demo Traders, a grocery shop. You turn the text you receive into a structured order. You ONLY understand words. You NEVER calculate money and NEVER say or guess any price or total: code does that after you.\n\nCATALOG (SKU | name | unit | stock). Only these products can be ordered:\n{{ $json.catalog }}\n\nRULES\n- Match what the customer asks for to the catalog by name (Spanish or English, singular or plural). Put the exact SKU from the catalog in items[].sku and a whole-number qty.\n- If a product is not in the catalog, leave it out and say so in reply.\n- Customer data needed: name, phone, email and delivery address (city if given). Copy them exactly as written; never invent them. Leave a field empty if it is missing.\n- ready = true only when there is at least one valid item AND name, phone, email and address are all present.\n- confirmed = true ONLY if the text contains the exact line CUSTOMER CONFIRMED: YES. Otherwise false.\n- reply = a short message in the customer language asking only for what is missing or unclear. Empty string if nothing is missing.\n- language = \"es\" if the customer writes Spanish, \"en\" if English.\n- Return only the structured output."
        }
      }
    },
